# Force LF regardless of a checkout machine's core.autocrlf setting. Without this,
# Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true convert these to CRLF, which silently
# corrupts any file whose bytes are read verbatim by a shell `$(cat ...)` substitution
# (a trailing \r survives command substitution's own trailing-\n stripping) — discovered
# while validating Task #92's secret-reading wrappers.
infrastructure/compose/secrets/*.txt.example text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
